      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MAJOR ILLUSION (3) is a talented type and proved too strong last time to win by a neck at this track in a handy 16.78 beating Sun In Cuba. Ran one of the fastest times on the program in his latest win. Has hit winning form and can go on with it. RATTLIN' BONES (1) turned in a fair run last time from an unfavourable draw finishing fourth by 5 lengths (19.46). Form here at the trip sound including six wins. Has ability and can atone. FLYING DOORMAT (4) goes very well this course and distance starting 10 times for five wins and three minors. Placed last time (22.73) at Geelong in a Grade 4/5, finishing third and beaten 5.5 lengths. Can feature with the right run. KARACHI (2) is worth consideration.",
